  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ikas Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Headquartered in Ankara, T&#xFC;rkiye, Ikas (or the Company) is a Turkish provider of ecommerce-enablement software that serves SMEs. Ikas provides a platform with user-friendly software offering tools required to create and operate online storefronts, facilitating product sales and brand exposure.&#xA0;   IFC is considering an equity investment of up to US$7 million in Ikas Series A round. The funding will support Ikas expansion in T&#xFC;rkiye and Germany.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IFC anticipates that the Project would result in improved access to e-commerce software for businesses, especially MSMEs, potentially resulting in improved access to markets and productivity gains for businesses. Beyond the Project, this investment has the potential to increase competitiveness of the market for market for e-commerce software in Turkey via innovation and competition channels.</narrative>
  </description>
